  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 19 June 2025). Our client Tanvi Shetty is a 26-year-old software engineer who lives at House No. 102, Peelamedu, Coimbatore 641055 and can be reached on 91977 13549 or tanvi.shetty@example.in. The client's PAN PEVPS3567G.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Fernandes Textiles Pvt Ltd. A cheque for INR 14,10,000/- issued by Fernandes Textiles Pvt Ltd bounced: the cheque came back with the remark account closed.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 152329384230 (IFSC SBIN0593907).\nThe matter was filed as S.C.C. No. 1817/2025 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Coimbatore on 28 November 2025.",
